  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As someone who changes the banner frequently for hiding/unhiding a currently worn avatar from the public profile and as of killing off `Build 1867` access to VRChat earlier today, the new UI introduced in `Build 1885` (up to the current `Build 1903`) requires 7 steps to change the banner where the previous UI required only 4 steps.\n\nExpected behavior (VRChat 2026.2.3p3 `Build 1867`): Open the Quick Menu, open your Profile, click the banner at top, select a banner.\n\nActual behavior (VRChat 2026.3.2p2 `Build 1903`): Open the Quick Menu, open your Profile, click Edit Profile, click Change Banner, select a banner, click Apply, click Save.\n\nI can't imagine this to be anything but unintended hostile user experience.",
